{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】立法會發展事務委員會今日(10月27日)開會討論新田科技城撥款申請，以及紅磡站周邊用地發展。另外，亞運香港運動員在沙田巴士巡遊，由沙田大會堂出發，經大圍到頌安邨。</p><p>採訪日誌｜立法會討論新田科技城撥款申請等／亞運香港運動員在沙田巴士巡遊</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T23:40:54.651850+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T23:33:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T23:58:24.401184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T23:38:44.519833+00:00","content_hash":"b8292efd1f9693934eb5bf96f72f7ef116e2f5b2f9fd5117d543221783f9399d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}